OL,3,GNEWSATraffic concerns over university's
OL,4,Ahousing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns that a university's proposed
OL,7,Fhousing developments could increase
OL,8,Ftraffic problems have led to a council
OL,9,Fformally objecting to them going ahead.
OL,11,FThe University of Reading wants to
OL,12,Fbuild the Loddon Valley Garden Village,
OL,13,Fwhich it hopes will eventually consist
OL,14,Fof about 4,000 homes, on land close to
OL,15,FShinfield and Lower Earley.
OL,17,FApproval is sought from Wokingham
OL,18,FBorough Council for the first stages,
OL,19,Fincluding for 2,800 homes at Hall Farm
OL,20,Fand another 430 homes at Mole Road in
OL,21,FSindlesham.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
